---
title: Website visitors
layout: page
hidden: true
sitemap: false
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
{%- comment -%}
  Hidden metrics page: reachable only through its secret address, not indexed, not in the sitemap.
  Numbers come from GoatCounter (cookieless, no personal data) and are refreshed daily by the
  deploy workflow. See README.md, "Analytics".
{%- endcomment -%}
<p class="muted">Updated {{ stats.generated }}. Counts are page views from <a href="https://www.goatcounter.com">GoatCounter</a>; no cookies or personal data are collected.</p>

<div class="stat-row">
  <div class="stat"><span class="stat-value">{{ stats.last30 }}</span><span class="stat-label">page views, last 30 days</span></div>
  <div class="stat"><span class="stat-value">{{ stats.last365 }}</span><span class="stat-label">page views, last 12 months</span></div>
</div>

<h2>Per day, last 30 days</h2>
<div class="bars" role="img" aria-label="Page views per day over the last 30 days">
  {%- for d in stats.daily %}
  <div class="bar" style="--h: {{ d.height }}%" title="{{ d.day }}: {{ d.count }}"><span class="visually-hidden">{{ d.day }}: {{ d.count }}</span></div>
  {%- endfor %}
</div>

<h2>Per month, last 12 months</h2>
<div class="bars bars-wide" role="img" aria-label="Page views per month over the last 12 months">
  {%- for d in stats.monthly %}
  <div class="bar" style="--h: {{ d.height }}%" title="{{ d.day }}: {{ d.count }}"><span class="bar-label">{{ d.day | slice: 5, 2 }}</span></div>
  {%- endfor %}
</div>

{%- assign tables = "pages:Most viewed pages,toprefs:Where visitors came from,locations:Countries,browsers:Browsers,systems:Operating systems,sizes:Screen sizes" | split: "," %}
<div class="stat-tables">
{%- for t in tables %}
  {%- assign parts = t | split: ":" %}
  {%- assign rows = stats[parts[0]] %}
  <section>
    <h2>{{ parts[1] }}</h2>
    <table class="table">
      <thead><tr><th>{% if parts[0] == "pages" %}Page{% else %}Name{% endif %}</th><th>Views</th><th>%</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        {%- for r in rows %}
        <tr><td>{% if parts[0] == "pages" %}<a href="{{ r.path }}">{{ r.title | default: r.path }}</a>{% else %}{{ r.name }}{% endif %}</td><td>{{ r.count }}</td><td>{{ r.percent }}</td></tr>
        {%- else %}
        <tr><td colspan="3" class="muted">No data yet.</td></tr>
        {%- endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </section>
{%- endfor %}
</div>
